\cf2 \cb4 Jasper is the marketing agents platform, built to help enterprises orchestrate AI agents that execute marketing work at scale. Purpose-built for marketing teams, Jasper enables faster, more consistent execution across campaigns, personalization, localization, and compliance\'97while maintaining enterprise-grade control and governance.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb4 Jasper is trusted by hundreds of enterprises worldwide, including Prudential, Cushman & Wakefield, and nearly 20% of the Fortune 500. Founded in 2021, Jasper has team members across the U.S., Australia, and France.\cb1 \
\
\cb4 About The Role\cb1 \
\cb4 As a Strategic AI Outcomes Manager, you'll partner with Jasper's largest enterprise customers to ensure they achieve measurable business outcomes with generative AI. You'll serve as a trusted strategic advisor, helping executive stakeholders define AI transformation strategies, identify high-value use cases, drive organizational adoption, and realize business value across marketing and other enterprise functions.\cb1 \
\
\cb4 This is not a commercial account management role. You will not own renewals, pricing, or contract negotiations. Instead, your success is measured by customer outcomes, executive relationships, AI maturity, and long-term strategic value creation. You'll operate alongside Account Executives, Solutions Architects, Product, Marketing, and Customer Education to help some of the world's most recognizable brands operationalize AI at scale.\cb1 \
\
\cb4 This fully remote role reports to the Director, AI Outcomes and is open to candidates located anywhere in the continental US.\cb1 \
\
